// N27-AB — Pacto de la Espada, tier 2: "Hoja Despierta" / "Waking Blade".
// Unlocked by spending the tier-2 point on `PactBladeSkill::SecondStrike`
// (`Simple(Some(PactBlade(SecondStrike)), ..)` in the manifest).
//
// The blade has woken up and no longer waits to be aimed: it comes round in a
// full circle on its own, biting everything in reach. Deliberately a
// DIFFERENT tactical role from the tier-0 strike rather than a bigger version
// of it -- `angle: 360` + `multi_target: Some(Normal)` against the base's
// 30-degree single-target cut -- so buying the tier adds an option (crowd
// answer, on an 8 s cooldown) rather than obsoleting the free-to-spam base
// strike, which stays the only thing available once this is on cooldown.
// Per-cast single-target dps is close between the two (base ~23.5, this
// ~23.6 plus the Bleeding rider) -- the real tradeoff is availability, not a
// single-target/AoE damage penalty.
//
// The `Bleeding` rider is the first hint of the tier-3 hunger to come
// (`PactBladeSkill::Hunger`) -- wounds this thing opens do not close. Kept at
// a fractional strength and a coin-flip chance, the same shape the shipped
// sword combos use, so it reads as flavour with teeth rather than a second
// damage budget.
//
// See pact_blade_mute.ron for why `source: Some(Arcane)` is load-bearing
// (proficiency exemption, magic to-hit, spell_power channel) and why `school`
// is unset.
BasicMelee(
    energy_cost: 25,
    buildup_duration: 0.45,
    swing_duration: 0.15,
    hit_timing: 0.4,
    recover_duration: 0.5,
    melee_constructor: (
        kind: Slash(
            damage: 26,
            poise: 16,
            knockback: 7,
            energy_regen: 0,
        ),
        range: 3.8,
        angle: 360.0,
        multi_target: Some(Normal),
        damage_effect: Some(Buff((
            kind: Bleeding,
            dur_secs: 8.0,
            strength: DamageFraction(0.15),
            chance: 0.5,
        ))),
    ),
    meta: (
        source: Some(Arcane),
        cooldown: Some(8.0),
    ),
)
